      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Chincoteague hosts the historic Assateague Lighthouse and Captain Timothy Hill House, both listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chincoteague%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Each July, Chincoteague’s Saltwater Cowboys herd wild ponies across the Assateague Channel, then auction the foals the following day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        26,
        27,
        28,
        29,
